{"type":"message","id":"6879d69c","parentId":"c8e992bb","timestamp":"2026-03-12T22:38:58.705Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_YGumAlz98NZjoh47xY2yTeM7|fc_086fdc6f20ce7e790169b3407e2fc48191af8c09cdefee8ca4","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: edict-dashboard-autostart\ndescription: Auto-start and verify the 三省六部 (Edict) web dashboard when the user asks to start/launch/open 三省六部, 军机处看板, Edict dashboard, or asks “网页看板在哪”. Use this skill to bring up the dashboard service at http://127.0.0.1:7891 and return the access URL quickly.\n---\n\n# Edict Dashboard Autostart\n\n1. Detect trigger intent.\n   - Trigger on requests like: “三省六部启动”, “启动看板”, “打开军机处”, “Edict dashboard”, “网页看板在哪”.\n\n2. Ensure service is reachable on `127.0.0.1:7891`.\n   - First check whether port 7891 is already listening.\n   - If listening, do not start a duplicate process.\n\n3. If not running, start dashboard backend.\n   - Working directory: `C:\\Users\\吗喽\\.openclaw\\workspace\\edict`\n   - Start command: `python dashboard/server.py --port <port>`\n   - Default port is `7891`; if user asks for fallback, auto-select an available port.\n   - Use background execution so chat is not blocked.\n\n4. Verify startup.\n   - Wait briefly, then confirm the process is alive or port is listening.\n   - If startup fails, report the error and suggest checking Python/environment.\n\n5. Reply format.\n   - Keep it short and action-first.\n   - Include direct URL: `http://127.0.0.1:7891`\n   - If LAN is needed, also include `http://<local-ip>:7891` when available.\n\n## Script\n\nUse `scripts/start-edict-dashboard.ps1` for deterministic startup/check operations.\n\n- Check only:\n  - `powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts/start-edict-dashboard.ps1 -CheckOnly`\n- Start if needed:\n  - `powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts/start-edict-dashboard.ps1`\n- Start with auto fallback port:\n  - `powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts/start-edict-dashboard.ps1 -AutoFallbackPort`\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773355138700}}
