{"type":"message","id":"4da72af8","parentId":"14fcd70f","timestamp":"2026-03-12T23:55:37.927Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"3AA42DECE4983D84D4BA\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"+817044772036\",\n  \"sender\": \"方越\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"方越 (+817044772036)\",\n  \"id\": \"+817044772036\",\n  \"name\": \"方越\",\n  \"e164\": \"+817044772036\"\n}\n```\n\n什么叫agent 先行，是只agent拿到指令后，先进行指令拆解，然后OK了，让skills去干活这样吗，"}],"timestamp":1773359737924}}
