现在要不要我直接开跑一次？你只要确认这三个输入用哪个版本：\n- 设计书：`design_latest2.xlsx` 还是别的  \n- 代码包：`code_latest.zip` 还是别的  \n- 模板：`template_v3_confirmed.xlsx`（建议这个）","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_021ce71f7d2291c40169b357eacbe481918287a9e113dd70bb\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":238,"output":337,"cacheRead":29952,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30527,"cost":{"input":0.0004165,"output":0.004718,"cacheRead":0.0052416,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0103761}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773361131965}}
