{"type":"message","id":"07cd64d3","parentId":"afcdb1b9","timestamp":"2026-03-15T22:45:06.725Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_FDHEEyzz7bl5iNv88gHr88TP|fc_081f1edf56a83d280169b7367008188191bc5f12bb8f85eac8","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"OpenViking - An Agent-native context database\n\nUsage: ov.exe [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>\n\nCommands:\n  add-resource  Add resources into OpenViking\n  add-skill     Add a skill into OpenViking\n  relations     List relations of a resource\n  link          Create relation links from one URI to one or more targets\n  unlink        Remove a relation link\n  export        Export context as .ovpack\n  import        Import .ovpack into target URI\n  wait          Wait for queued async processing to complete\n  status        Show OpenViking component status\n  health        Quick health check\n  system        System utility commands\n  observer      Observer status commands\n  session       Session management commands\n  admin         Account and user management commands (multi-tenant)\n  ls            List directory contents\n  tree          Get directory tree\n  mkdir         Create directory\n  rm            Remove resource\n  mv            Move or rename resource\n  stat          Get resource metadata\n  read          Read file content (L2)\n  abstract      Read abstract content (L0)\n  overview      Read overview content (L1)\n  find          Run semantic retrieval\n  search        Run context-aware retrieval\n  grep          Run content pattern search\n  glob          Run file glob pattern search\n  add-memory    Add memory in one shot (creates session, adds messages, commits)\n  tui           Interactive TUI file explorer\n  chat          Chat with vikingbot agent\n  config        Configuration management\n  version       Show CLI version\n  help          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n\nOptions:\n  -o, --output <OUTPUT>  Output format [default: table]\n  -c, --compact          Compact representation, defaults to true - compacts JSON output or uses simplified representation for Table output\n  -h, --help             Print help\n  -V, --version          Print version"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":474,"aggregated":"OpenViking - An Agent-native context database\n\nUsage: ov.exe [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>\n\nCommands:\n  add-resource  Add resources into OpenViking\n  add-skill     Add a skill into OpenViking\n  relations     List relations of a resource\n  link          Create relation links from one URI to one or more targets\n  unlink        Remove a relation link\n  export        Export context as .ovpack\n  import        Import .ovpack into target URI\n  wait          Wait for queued async processing to complete\n  status        Show OpenViking component status\n  health        Quick health check\n  system        System utility commands\n  observer      Observer status commands\n  session       Session management commands\n  admin         Account and user management commands (multi-tenant)\n  ls            List directory contents\n  tree          Get directory tree\n  mkdir         Create directory\n  rm            Remove resource\n  mv            Move or rename resource\n  stat          Get resource metadata\n  read          Read file content (L2)\n  abstract      Read abstract content (L0)\n  overview      Read overview content (L1)\n  find          Run semantic retrieval\n  search        Run context-aware retrieval\n  grep          Run content pattern search\n  glob          Run file glob pattern search\n  add-memory    Add memory in one shot (creates session, adds messages, commits)\n  tui           Interactive TUI file explorer\n  chat          Chat with vikingbot agent\n  config        Configuration management\n  version       Show CLI version\n  help          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n\nOptions:\n  -o, --output <OUTPUT>  Output format [default: table]\n  -c, --compact  