{"type":"message","id":"3c77fac6","parentId":"d4e2bf56","timestamp":"2026-03-15T23:01:06.647Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_070b4a1011ee665f0169b73a2b2e0c819193f378fb49b7bf5b\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABptzorveXSTAjXpMPKSyrLUj_85lZRBtCSphaCThbnSKJ8usb0VOuUByMsyKWEoc8kNygQ_d57DI0ay8wcOmX6_OaL_MftL2iLxdRTjUMklmsylZFhBhiWcT-W19pY5BLSmV0vnp3-sH8-kUhZwqmvYsba4isw77NMRyLFIjG6CE1H5KtuMjf7BozbZATu0WmNm65SlFdmbTdoijpzs3lGzXBzZZx9gW8oJPgHOFso-XLniLp7xKaxE-MWBm7-Q4nb6Q4BdJcrZgZGvsAbiIPW4KtOZ2WLG-uYFAUOqI2yDf0ycJ7SwDmKn5DsbhMHMw28RHeqsyy-pGLdlIFKFm6AJA4n8RKblt55Gda792yMzdIWlDnbL6LtBGhy6dP5qxO2GqbIFe9L_RfLzDHpgBQZ_ge4KVYtNHbArcKTrzolKYuMCaAdY-arUhMmmKRBzuIe99XKMMkiHZbCY_GJUJKneF-mboj1le2-wcABtTyIh6mjMqknXTrlkNQl5eeNwxaeqSI8U1sT5LpbmGwvPLkwlWZIrjlvmaXc4tKmLG9xWAlIwePGM1r-71qtmHOb-qxtluwLZHgnj_yLWYedaqZ8z0HHuN71fa_oaI_FobXEa2PUHquIlzdeiD6XCsjNPiliWrwS_AuggZ_Xx1Lpzr6gmazmtWyHQsYeit5A5aHwbMYl5rjeeaC2Sh_tOvShnguuQQhaxFFbty-jj9jXuohItAL9H6THo3NZqng8L25SWY_xvPRNwZvQsCZouo1hqb-AcZZkAD_c39IXJF1IVDDzalLKiei0FFmz4nQlIFZgbKcMMWgNGg55_M6Q_BGPvL4tDmc-uGlt6hsjLL7MUzNTtCe4-UFj2CWLd8C-AA_V3G7GyT_ldi1yZP_7P2TiC3GnOvzeulbnRhVngJN8r0mDxEs1me3FzREQmt9bcxn_FBOY3IUqjHBGT09VqInKPfdwFv65\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 简单说：**OpenViking 是“上下文数据库 + 检索服务”**，不是纯本地小工具。  \n它的很多能力会调用后端服务/模型，所以要 `api_key` 做鉴权和计费归属。\n\n**原理（通俗版）**  \n1. 你把资料喂进去（文档、代码、会话）  \n2. 它做解析、切片、建索引（向量/结构化元数据）  \n3. 你查询时，它先检索最相关上下文，再组织返回  \n4. 某些场景会调用模型做理解/摘要/推理（这一步通常需要云端）\n\n**为什么要 API key**  \n- 识别“你是谁”（权限）  \n- 限流、防滥用  \n- 计费/配额归属  \n- 访问云端模型或服务接口\n\n所以你看到要配 `~/.openviking/ov.conf` 的 `api_key`，本质是让 CLI 能合法访问它的服务端能力。  \n如果只做极少数纯本地命令，有些可能不依赖 key；但**完整功能基本都需要**。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_070b4a1011ee665f0169b73a2bc69c81919e6caba8e04f55e0\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":351,"output":292,"cacheRead":39168,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39811,"cost":{"input":0.00061425,"output":0.004088,"cacheRead":0.0068544,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01155665}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773615659435}}
