增卡片图片自动上传  \n  4) OAPI 工具层与消息发送逻辑优化\n\n所以这是 **Lark 适配侧** 的更新，不是 OpenClaw 核心仓库更新。  \n如果你要，我可以下一步帮你评估：你当前环境是否需要跟这个 PR 对齐。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0c2670ccc256b64f0169b74cc7ca408191a4c2079e29b7eb1d\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":1685,"output":300,"cacheRead":78592,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":80577,"cost":{"input":0.00294875,"output":0.0042,"cacheRead":0.0137536,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02090235}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773620422173}}
