{"type":"message","id":"2a877df0","parentId":"8951c750","timestamp":"2026-03-16T13:16:06.705Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_axXW53RR3j4rCpSZxiqHWhVN|fc_006555010be480330169b80295c6408191b267820f0053fb52","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ŀ¼: C:\\Users\\���\\.openclaw\\workspace\\skills\\web-unit-testbook\r\n\r\n\r\nMode                 LastWriteTime         Length Name                                                                 \r\n----                 -------------         ------ ----                                                                 \r\n-a----          2026/3/3     21:39             51 requirements.txt                                                     \r\n-a----          2026/3/9     22:14           1998 SKILL.md                                                             \r\n\r\n\r\n    Ŀ¼: C:\\Users\\���\\.openclaw\\workspace\\skills\\web-unit-testbook\\scripts\r\n\r\n\r\nMode                 LastWriteTime         Length Name                                                                 \r\n----                 -------------         ------ ----                                                                 \r\n-a----          2026/3/6     13:31           2417 export_template_strict.py                                            \r\n-a----          2026/3/6     13:18           2640 export_to_excel.py                                                   \r\n-a----          2026/3/3     21:45           3458 extract_code_rules.py                                                \r\n-a----          2026/3/9     21:56           5922 generate_cases_by_template_semantics.py                              \r\n-a----          2026/3/6     14:34           4131 generate_from_design_code_jp.py                                      \r\n-a----          2026/3/6     14:22           4671 generate_from_template_skeleton.py                                   \r\n-a----          2026/3/6     13:30           4519 generate_high_prec